[{"type":"message","user":"U02GRF737B2","text":"\u003c@U02GRF737B2\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632917060.156300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d89e8ee4-9449-4a17-b7d8-5ca3d31a6057","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"標準 package だけずれるんですよね","ts":"1632914387.156100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"600ceea4-26fd-4bd5-83a8-46371bc18b47","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"go install は真の意味でバージョン固定はできない、というのをこないだ踏みました","ts":"1632914314.155000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yBF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eaf4d2d3-96ac-4ef7-a7eb-e19fe5089456","type":"message","user":"UFYACJ537","text":"dependabotのためにtools/go.modしてる…卒業したい","ts":"1632897641.153800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ox4R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d566cb19-f348-4ae4-85c5-cfa92f91e7ad","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"この支配からの卒業","ts":"1632897328.153100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ktFU0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ce41a46-cbba-4837-b86c-a6674bb0bf17","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"tools.go はみな卒業する流れがあったりしますね。","ts":"1632897225.152800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kTSDN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e8f4e5c-85f4-4884-ae2d-f70311a0a1f5","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"バージョン指定すればいいといえばいいのかもしれないが。","ts":"1632896547.152300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VGNO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59e8a1d4-db9c-4076-bfad-7ac3dd56e39d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"go generate するときに go run することがあって、その時のバージョン指定のために tools.go つかっちゃったりしてますね","ts":"1632896529.152000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6MAv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c91455ea-1bea-478e-9962-ebc2d749aa70","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"tools.go作ってツールのバージョンをgo.modに記録するやり方はgo intallのバージョンつきが出来るようになったので不要のはず。","ts":"1632896043.151400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qu0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9756f5c6-a673-4889-b233-f17610107c25","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":":kakko-kabu-tojikakko:","ts":"1632895942.150700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kakko-kabu-tojikakko","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hfe0I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"953092e0-f394-4353-8241-7391864f7580","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ツールの固定バージョンが欲しいなら go inastall package@version をシェルにでも書いておくのが一番ラクすね。\n複数バージョンが欲しいとかいい感じにアップデートしたいなら3rd party toolがいくつかあったはず。","ts":"1632895868.150500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Kvmg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b677482-9507-4659-beb9-784a03b0235a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`go install \u003chttp://github.com/user/repo/cmd/command@version|github.com/user/repo/cmd/command@version\u003e` すれば、 `$GOPATH/bin` にバージョン管理してインストールできますね","ts":"1632895795.149700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8FFs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0848af85-caca-44a2-9cad-0ece7deaf5a5","type":"message","user":"U0M7GCBPD","text":"結局面倒で毎回手動インストールしてる","ts":"1632895639.148800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=/=3g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0895daa1-b4ec-4699-b101-7ce99df54b1f","type":"message","user":"U0M7GCBPD","text":"ちゃんとツールもバージョン管理したければ dotfile リポジトリとかに go.mod 置いて管理すればいいのかな","ts":"1632895623.148400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y/2ee"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c74110ce-d150-4290-bc42-4424fffb60d0","type":"message","user":"U0M7GCBPD","text":"GOPATH 捨てるのは全然問題ない（というか既に環境変数も設定してなかったはず）なのですでに GOPATH free です！","ts":"1632895572.147500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rlp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b5ee994-2019-409e-bee5-405261a76e8b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あった\n\u003chttps://zenn.dev/tennashi/articles/3b87a8d924bc9c43573e\u003e","ts":"1632892259.146500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Zenn: GOPATH に(可能な限り)依存しない Go 開発環境(Go 1.15 版)","id":1,"title":"GOPATH に(可能な限り)依存しない Go 開発環境(Go 1.15 版)","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/tennashi/articles/3b87a8d924bc9c43573e","image_url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/zenn/image/upload/s--ubhlL1Fe--/co_rgb:222%2Cg_south_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_37_bold:tennashi%2Cx_203%2Cy_98/c_fit%2Cco_rgb:222%2Cg_north_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_70_bold:GOPATH%2520%25E3%2581%25AB%2528%25E5%258F%25AF%25E8%2583%25BD%25E3%2581%25AA%25E9%2599%2590%25E3%2582%258A%2529%25E4%25BE%259D%25E5%25AD%2598%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2581%2584%2520Go%2520%25E9%2596%258B%25E7%2599%25BA%25E7%2592%25B0%25E5%25A2%2583%2528Go%25201.15%2520%25E7%2589%2588%2529%2Cw_1010%2Cx_90%2Cy_100/g_south_west%2Ch_90%2Cl_fetch:aHR0cHM6Ly9saDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2EtL0FPaDE0R2hZZ3VkaFNhNEQyS0E5dDc2RnBweHFkN1lYRUZhcE9na1JlbW89czgwLWM=%2Cr_max%2Cw_90%2Cx_87%2Cy_72/v1627274783/default/og-base_z4sxah.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Zenn","service_icon":"https://zenn.dev/images/icon.png","from_url":"https://zenn.dev/tennashi/articles/3b87a8d924bc9c43573e","original_url":"https://zenn.dev/tennashi/articles/3b87a8d924bc9c43573e"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OpDO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e37caa1-ce07-4426-96ae-1a7313a3626d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"一時的に使いたいツールなら `go run \u003chttp://github.com/user/repo/cmd/command@latest|github.com/user/repo/cmd/command@latest\u003e` とかで走らせる方法もありますね","ts":"1632892251.146300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hBt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c1618fa-0af6-46f1-b8a9-3a326429ed28","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"一応GOBINを無理やり設定することも。","ts":"1632892235.145900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DGt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2f1de6e-4e00-4f37-8c62-39e3124d412d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、一部 global install なツールは再インストール必要ですね","ts":"1632892205.145100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aje"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95abdc3b-ebc0-4a57-b71c-4095e0ce00ff","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"GOPATHとともに生きるのをやめるって手もあります\n記事どこだっけ…","ts":"1632892169.144400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B7Jy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52b9cb85-dac0-429c-ae5b-b916df5b6571","type":"message","user":"U0M7GCBPD","text":"なるほど…！go get でできるならそれが一番簡単そう\nGOPATH ごとまるっと変わるって訳ではないですよね（gvm だとバージョンごとの GOPATH があるのでツールは再インストールしなおし）","ts":"1632892023.143900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hg4J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e454aaa1-eacc-434f-a9cb-049f1653ff8e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ぼくは昔出したバイナリをコンパイルしたのと同じ版で検証、みたいなことが極まれに発生するので。","ts":"1632889110.141900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UPKr8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ED0F6D48-C76A-4C9D-AC80-BFB8B0EDA104","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"homebrewに落ちてきたらすぐ更新する派","ts":"1632888889.140800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U7H4TJEG0","U023H98P3N0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gL7b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e137add9-c188-486c-9b0d-bf0924b1ec73","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"自分用は先っちょしか使わない派。","ts":"1632888604.139700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":4,"users":["US90LD360","U9S4G0LJW","U023H98P3N0","UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2VzHq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60b5b19b-3436-4e87-b620-62f05f02e77b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああいまはWinでもいけるんだ","ts":"1632884630.139100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1632884656.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E+0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"694ee224-4c83-4319-91e6-5765372d11d7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Windows でもいけますね","ts":"1632884622.138900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U8cMH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e0de725-472b-4209-903b-ff34f4aad195","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`go get \u003chttp://golang.org/dl/go[version]|golang.org/dl/go[version]\u003e` してます","ts":"1632884617.138700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mdyRj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75251699-338b-409d-825c-608195600c22","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Linuxとかならgo自体がバージョンマネージャーになるはず。","ts":"1632884573.138100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GG0x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b525c74e-0c69-4ca0-b24d-313f2a311137","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕は自前の。まぁ更新してない(する必要がない)ってのは同じなんだけども。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/koron/goup\u003e","ts":"1632884559.137600","thread_ts":"1632884559.137600","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"koron/goup","id":1,"title":"koron/goup","text":"Utility to download, extract and switch released go versions ","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"4","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Go","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S8y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a4fa33e-4281-4feb-8510-f1ca2e681d54","type":"message","user":"U0M7GCBPD","text":"gvm が更新されてないので乗り換えたいんですが、皆さんバージョンマネージャー何使ってますか？","ts":"1632884358.136900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1qP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6388cd2-2875-44a8-b89e-b9945078ae6d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"これはcurrentって名前でsymlink作って、そっちにパスを通しておくことで複数バージョンをswitchできるようになってる。","ts":"1632884741.139300","thread_ts":"1632884559.137600","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o/=Hz"}]}]
